    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:c3205ac1e20a266d",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "7895e38fc2a5f53434571ec1799ed2b76e17fd103d4428126ece02d6f13b8218",
      "text": "Embark on an unforgettable full-day boat tour of Lake Titicaca, the highest navigable lake in the world. Your adventure begins with a visit to the Uros Floating Islands, a unique group of islands made entirely of totora reeds. Here, you’ll have the chance to meet the indigenous Uros people, learn about their traditional way of life, and explore the islands that have been built and maintained by the community for centuries.\n\nNext, continue to Taquile Island, renowned for its rich cultural heritage and stunning landscapes. On the island, you can immerse yourself in the local traditions, including the famous weaving techniques that have been passed down through generations. You’ll also enjoy panoramic views of the lake and the surrounding mountains. In the late afternoon, return to Puno.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1IJ-ifZl_wfTwk-xMrqNJcO6OBMQunbcA",
        "documentSha256": "e72781a19f85cef319201422e08f82b1f3826c037805c98f97b2081b4eed559c",
